SUMMARY:Brown County Songwriter Showdown - Round 2
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Brown County Playhouse as local singer-songwriters take the stage to battle it out with original music. You get to be the judge\, so vote for your favorites and help decide who moves on to the FINALS!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n🎵 OCT 22 – Tim Mattingly\, Taylor Hernly\, Whiskey Hollow\, Sharianne Whetstine\, Emmett Ransom\, Chris Wolf\n🎵 OCT 29 – Jon and Sarah Giddens\, Brent Pierce\, Whiskey Graves\, Dakota Curtis\, Skinner\, Jake Cruser \nSupport local live music\, discover new voices\, and be part of the excitement! \nA huge thank you to our sponsors! Featured sponsor: Hills O’Brown Vacation Rentals. Supporting sponsors: Amplify Nashville\, Overlook Services\, and Rainwater Studios. And a shoutout to our radio partners\, Hoosier Country 105.1 FM WHCC and B97 WBWB! \n* Participants are subject to change without notice. \n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/brown-county-songwriter-showdown-round2-oct29/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:Featured Event,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-songwriter_web_event.jpg
END:VEVENT
