SUMMARY:Thurston Howell – Yacht Rock Spectacular!
DESCRIPTION:Prepare yourself to escape with your Pina colada on a musical escapade that whisks you away on a nostalgic odyssey through the smoothest soft rock hits of the 70s and 80s\, a time of tube socks with colored stripes\, Big wheels and weeble wobbles\, bicycles with banana seats\, and kitchen phones with 20 foot curly cords. Get ready to set sail with Thurston Howell – Your Premier Yacht Rock Spectacular! \n\nBUY TICKETS
URL:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/event/thurston-howell-yacht-rock-2026/
LOCATION:Brown County Playhouse\, 70 S. Van Buren St\, Nashville\, IN\, 47448\, United States
CATEGORIES:80s Music,Clasic Rock,Featured Event,Music,Pop Music,Pop Rock
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncountyplayhouse.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2026-ThurstonHowell_web_event.jpg
