SUMMARY:The Woomblies Rock Orchestra [SOLD OUT]
DESCRIPTION:SOLD OUT! \nThe Woomblies Rock Orchestra is a powerhouse of talent. Ten musicians\, including a four-piece string section\, and two horns\, playing some of the greatest Rock and Motown music ever written. Music from Rock bands like ELO\, Moody Blues\, and Led Zeppelin – and greats like Al Greene and The Four Tops. \nSOLD OUT!\n\n \n  \n 
